      123       run bufcomp-set-field-param in this-procedure  ( input "recipe":U    , input trim( "recipe-name     ":U )   , input trim( "Назв.рецепта     ":U )   ).
      124       run bufcomp-set-field-param in this-procedure  ( input "recipe":U    , input trim( "recipe-order    ":U )   , input trim( "Порядок          ":U )   ).
